### HiBank Core API - HTTP Client Test Collection
### Gunakan dengan ekstensi REST Client (VS Code / Cursor) atau JetBrains HTTP Client.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Liveness Probe (Cek apakah aplikasi hidup)
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Readiness Probe (Cek koneksi database PostgreSQL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. V1 Ping (Cek routing API v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/ping
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Sprint 1 - Register User Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Ihsan Pratama",
  "email": "ihsan@hibank.com",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "password": "SuperSecretPassword123!"
}

###

### 5. Sprint 1 - Login
# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@hibank.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "device_id": "iphone-15-pro-max"
}

###

### Simpan session token dari login untuk request selanjutnya
@sessionToken = {{loginRequest.response.body.session_token}}

### 6. Touch / Extend Session (Sliding Inactivity Window)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "session_token": "{{sessionToken}}"
}

###

### 7. Logout (Immediate Revocation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/logout
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

###

### 8. Custom Request ID Header Tracing Test
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json
X-Request-Id: manual-test-trace-id-12345

###
### =========================================================================
### Sprint 2: User Profile & Security PIN
### =========================================================================

### 9. Get Authenticated User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

###

### 10. Set / Update 6-Digit Transaction PIN (Initial Setup)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/pin
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "pin": "123456"
}

###

### 11. Change 6-Digit Transaction PIN (With Current Old PIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/pin
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "pin": "654321",
  "old_pin": "123456"
}

###
### =========================================================================
### Sprint 3: Accounts Management
### =========================================================================

### 12. Open New Savings Account
# @name createAccountRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "account_type": "SAVINGS"
}

###

### Simpan ID rekening dari request pembuatan untuk cek detail
@createdAccountId = {{createAccountRequest.response.body.id}}

### 13. List All Customer Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

###

### 14. Get Account Detail By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{createdAccountId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

###
### =========================================================================
### Sprint 4: Double-Entry Ledger & Mutations
### =========================================================================

### 15. Get Account Mutations History (First Page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{createdAccountId}}/mutations?limit=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

###

### 16. Get Account Mutations History (Next Page using Cursor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{createdAccountId}}/mutations?cursor=MjAyNi0xMC0xN1QxNDozMDowMFp8YjEyZTE5ZDctODMyNi00NzA1LTliMmEtODc0MjgxMzU4OTEx&limit=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

###
### =========================================================================
### Sprint 5: Transfers Management
### =========================================================================

### 17. Transfer Inquiry (Check Recipient & PII Masking)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/transfers/inquiry
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "source_account_id": "{{createdAccountId}}",
  "target_account_number": "1088291040"
}

###

### 18. Execute Intra-Bank Transfer (With Idempotency-Key & PIN)
# @name executeTransferRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/transfers
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Idempotency-Key: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4a5b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d

{
  "source_account_id": "{{createdAccountId}}",
  "target_account_number": "1088291040",
  "amount": 50000,
  "notes": "Bayar kopi",
  "pin": "123456"
}

###

@executedTransactionId = {{executeTransferRequest.response.body.transaction_id}}

### 19. Get Transfer Receipt
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/transfers/{{executedTransactionId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}




